      "category": "interaction",
      "traits": [
        "detection"
      ],
      "text": "Belcorra can sense the presence of magic auras as though she were always using a 1st-rank Detect Magic spell. When she Seeks, she gains the benefits of a 3rd-rank detect magic spell on things she sees."
