    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Rejuvenation",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "When Belcorra is destroyed, she re-forms in 2d4 days within the Empty Vault (though she can reduce that time by empowering herself with glimmers of Nhimbaloth's essence using the Ebon Fulcrum Lens).\n\nBelcorra can only be permanently destroyed if she enacts her full revenge on Absalom or if Nhimbaloth devours her soul."
    },
